<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Hi {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Welcome to EverQuote! Thank you for choosing to grow your business with us.&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">My name is {!Case.OwnerFirstName}. I’m excited to be your personal account manager and business consultant. My job is to help you get the most out of your EverQuote account and offer any support you need, such as:&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">•	General account questions&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">•	Optimizing your campaigns&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">•	Reviewing the status of returned leads&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">•	Billing questions or changes&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">I’ve made my career helping agents and producers connect with online consumers to grow their businesses. Every day, I work with some of the biggest and best {!Account.Carrier__c} agents in the country, and I’d love to share with you how they drive success with EverQuote. You can also find a wealth of useful information and advice from agents like you on our agency blog, at&nbsp;</span><a href="http://learn.everquote.com/" target="_blank" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;">Learn.EverQuote.com</a><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">.&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.OwnerFullName}&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.OwnerTitle}&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">EverQuote&nbsp;</span><br style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.OwnerPhone}</span>]]></td>
</tr>
